    <!-- Mount mode pros/cons -->
    <s:String x:Key="Str_ModePhysicalPros">Maximum compatibility, Windows Search indexing, Recycle Bin and native operations; better performance on large copies.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str_ModePhysicalCons">Requires WinFsp; slower startup; sensitive to network drops (may freeze Explorer).</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str_ModeNetworkPros">Does not require WinFsp in local mode; fast startup; tolerant to disconnections; ideal for remote access.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str_ModeNetworkCons">Some apps do not see it as a real disk; no indexing or Recycle Bin; slightly lower performance on massive copies.</s:String>

